SUMMARY:Welcome Summer! Nature Discovery Walk
DESCRIPTION:Ever spot a mystery plant or critter and wish you knew its name? Lace up for a nature walk through our prairies and woods! We’ll be using iNaturalist to do some identifying along the way and submit our observations to contribute to collaborative science in this program for ages 5+. \nRegister
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/welcome-summer-nature-discovery-walk/
LOCATION:Prairie Ridge\, 1671 Gold Star Drive\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27607\, United States
