SUMMARY:Intro to Entomology
DESCRIPTION:It’s ecoEXPLORE’s Entomology Season\, so let’s learn about the study of insects\, entomology! Join us to discover how long insects have been on our planet\, where insects live\, what kinds of things entomologists study\, and more. This virtual program will get you ready to participate in Entomology Season with ecoEXPLORE! \nRegister
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/intro-to-entomology-2026/
LOCATION:Virtual\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children,ecoEXPLORE,K-12 Students,Teens,Virtual
ORGANIZER;CN="ecoEXPLORE%20Team":MAILTO:ecoexplore@naturalsciences.org
END:VEVENT
